  "body": "In https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/773321 @yutakahirano and @tyoshino work on a MIME type parser for XMLHttpRequest that is quite a bit stricter than the proposal in #36 (though not as strict as the RFC as far as I can tell; failing on `text/html;` would also undoubtedly break sites). If we can actually use that all over the web platform that is arguably somewhat better.\r\n\r\nThis is to track its success. I'd rather not block #36 on the outcome, but use the outcome to further refine the tests already written and the standard itself.",
